  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of school bags for children affected by war</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Ukraine&#x2019;s &#x2018;School Bag Campaign&#x2019; has been running annually for 23 years, providing backpacks and stationery sets for schoolchildren. The need has been exacerbated by the war and is currently very high, with more than 8,000 complete backpacks needed. CUA&#x2019;s fundraising goal for the 2024 School Bag Campaign is 3.5 million UAH (~85,000 EUR). The cost of purchasing and equipping one backpack is approximately 2,200 UAH (~42-50 EUR). 

In 2024, CAFOD launched our own fundraising campaign as part of the wider Ukraine Emergency Appeal to raise funds for CUA&#x2019;s school bag fundraising campaign. Funds raised are intended to be transferred in their entirety to CUA. Funds raised at closure of appeal (30/08/2024): &#xa3;1,969.60 (see https://donors.cafod.org.uk/page/ukrainianschoolbags).</narrative>
  </description>
